BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Mot Dang//motdang.net//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:มดแดง — เทศกาลที่มีวันแน่นอน / Mot Dang festivals with dates
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Bangkok
X-WR-CALDESC:Two kinds of entry. Recurring festivals with a fixed Gregorian date\, as yearly rules. And festivals whose dates an official source has actually announced\, as one-off events carrying the announcing body in the description. Lunar and not-yet-announced festivals are deliberately absent: they have a date rule\, not a date. The rules themselves are at https://motdang.net/festivals.html
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:festival-songkran-pi-mai-muang@motdang.net
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260413
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260418
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:สงกรานต์ (ปี๋ใหม่เมือง) · Songkran — Thai & Lanna New Year
DESCRIPTION:Known worldwide as Songkran\, but in Chiang Mai and Chiang Rai it's also ปี๋ใหม่เมือง ("Lanna New Year") — merit-making\, sand offerings at the wat\, and rod nam dam hua (pouring water over elders' hands for blessing) alongside the citywide water fights\, most famous around Chiang Mai's old-city moat.
URL:https://motdang.net/festivals/songkran-pi-mai-muang.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:festival-kings-birthday@motdang.net
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260728
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260729
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:วันเฉลิมพระชนมพรรษา รัชกาลที่ 10 · H.M. the King's Birthday
DESCRIPTION:A public holiday\, with morning alms-giving and an evening candle ceremony at provincial halls and the larger wats.
URL:https://motdang.net/festivals/kings-birthday.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:festival-mothers-day@motdang.net
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260812
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260813
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:วันแม่แห่งชาติ · Mother's Day — H.M. Queen Sirikit the Queen Mother's Birthday
DESCRIPTION:A public holiday. Children give their mothers jasmine garlands\, schools hold morning ceremonies\, and it is the florists' biggest day of the year.
URL:https://motdang.net/festivals/mothers-day.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:festival-fathers-day@motdang.net
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:วันพ่อแห่งชาติ · Father's Day — King Bhumibol Memorial Day
DESCRIPTION:A public holiday marking King Bhumibol's birthday and National Father's Day\; the canna lily is the flower of the day.
URL:https://motdang.net/festivals/fathers-day.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:festival-nye-countdown@motdang.net
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:เคานต์ดาวน์ส่งท้ายปีเก่า · New Year's Eve countdown
DESCRIPTION:Chiang Mai counts down at Tha Phae Gate and Chiang Rai at the clock tower — while plenty of people see the year over at a wat instead\, chanting through midnight as the temple bells go.
URL:https://motdang.net/festivals/nye-countdown.html
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
